  'cbd-water-outage-burst-pipe-2026-10-15',
  'Pretoria CBD water outage continues days after major pipe burst',
  'Utilities', '2026-10-15', 'Pretoria Rekord', 'https://www.citizen.co.za/rekord/news-headlines/2026/10/15/mayor-visits-burst-site-as-cbd-water-shortages-persist/',
  'A burst 1,000mm pipe near Pretoria Station has left parts of the CBD and nearby suburbs without a full water supply since 12 October.',
  'A 1,000mm water pipe burst near Pretoria Station on 12 October has disrupted supply to large parts of the Pretoria CBD and neighbouring suburbs, and the City of Tshwane is still working days later to get pressure back to normal. The affected area runs from the upper CBD near the station through Sunnyside, Arcadia, Eastwood, Bryntirion, Lisdogan Park and Balmoral.

Technical teams dug up the site, tightened a loose pipe joint, fitted a new seal and replaced a damaged section before partly reopening the valve. Crews have also been opening hydrants to let trapped air escape while the system refills. City spokesperson Lindela Mashigo said the system is steadily filling but that supply has not returned to normal everywhere, and warned residents to expect low pressure or none at all while repairs continue.

Executive Mayor Nasiphi Moya visited the repair site this week and apologised for the disruption, telling residents the city is sorry "for the inconvenience" the burst has caused to homes and businesses. She said work on site was progressing well. The municipality has sent water tankers to the affected areas and has not given a timeline for full restoration, asking residents to be patient while the system is fully repaired and tested.',
  NULL, NULL, NULL,
  '["https://www.citizen.co.za/rekord/news-headlines/2026/10/15/mayor-visits-burst-site-as-cbd-water-shortages-persist/", "https://www.citizen.co.za/rekord/uncategorized/2026/10/13/burst-pipeline-cuts-water-supply-to-pretoria-cbd-and-surrounding-suburbs/", "https://www.ebnewsdaily.co.za/2026/10/12/burst-pipe-disrupts-water-supply-in-pretoria-cbd-and-nearby-suburbs/", "https://x.com/CityTshwane/status/2069110135604084759"]',
  'agent'
);
